              - [anAssociation.ownedEnd->first().u_docMultiplicity()/]
              - [if (anAssociation.ownedComment->asSequence()->collect(temp9 | temp9.body)->toString().trim().size() > 0)]:abbr:`[anAssociation.u_shortAssociationName()/]([anAssociation.ownedComment->asSequence()->collect(temp8 | temp8.body)->toString().trim()/])`[else][anAssociation.u_shortAssociationName()/][/if]
              - [anAssociation.ownedEnd->first().getOtherEnd().u_docMultiplicity()/]
              - [anAssociation.ownedEnd->first().getOtherEnd().aggregation/]
              - [if (anAssociation.ownedEnd->first().getOtherEnd().isNavigable())]x[/if]
              - :ref:`[anAssociation.ownedEnd->first().getOtherEnd().type.qualifiedName/]`
